# Dependency Graph — PHireScript Compiler
# Text representation — no tooling available for diagram generation

## Compilation Flow Dependencies

bin/build
  └── Compiler::compile()
        ├── FileManager (config, file I/O, watch)
        ├── DependencyGraphBuilder (topological sort, caching)
        ├── TranspilerDependencyTree (light parse for dependency graph)
        └── Transpiler::parseAndBind() / checkAndEmit()
              ├── Scanner (tokenize)
              ├── Validator (pre-parse check + ModifiersTransform)
              ├── Parser (AST)
              │     ├── ContextManager (context stack)
              │     ├── TokenManager (cursor)
              │     ├── SymbolTableManager (type-method registry)
              │     ├── VariableManager (scope)
              │     ├── Contexts (one per construct)
              │     ├── Resolvers (token matchers)
              │     └── Nodes (data holders)
              ├── Binder (PassDiscovery → sorted Binder impls)
              │     └── SymbolTable (global type registry)
              ├── Checker (PassDiscovery → sorted Checker impls)
              ├── Emitter (EmitterDispatcher → NodeEmitters)
              │     ├── EmitContext (shared state)
              │     ├── PhpTypeResolver (type mapping)
              │     └── UseRegistry (PHP use statements)
              └── PhpFileGeneratorHandler (nikic/php-parser)
                    ├── Visitors: TypeCollector, StringObjectTransformer, ...
                    └── PrettyPrinter

## Key Shared State

SymbolTable          shared across all files; written during Bind, read during Check/Emit
EmitterDispatcher    built once; fast-path cached
PassDiscovery        discovers Binder/Checker impls via reflection at startup
CompilerContext      read-only runtime config passed through all phases

## Subsystem Isolation

Scanner    → no deps on other compiler subsystems
Validator  → depends on Scanner output (Token[])
Parser     → depends on Validator output (Token[]); writes to SymbolTable via SymbolTableManager
Binder     → depends on Parser AST; writes to SymbolTable
Checker    → depends on Binder output (annotated AST); reads SymbolTable
Emitter    → depends on Checker output; reads SymbolTable; writes to UseRegistry
Processors → depends on Emitter string output; uses nikic/php-parser

## External Dependencies

nikic/php-parser ^5.0   → post-emission AST transformation
PHPUnit ^12.5           → tests only
PHPStan, PHPMD, Rector  → dev/CI quality tools only
